 "text": "Home / LaGrange County, Indiana\nSkip over navigation\nLaGrange County, Indiana\nSearch\nSubmit\nMenu\nHome\nGovernment  Assessor\nAuditor\nBuilding\nCircuit Court\nClerk\nCoroner\nCommissioners\nCounty Council\nEmergency Management Agency\nGIS\nHealth\nHighway\nHuman Resources\nMaintenance\nParks\nPlanning & Zoning\nProbation\nProsecuting Attorney\nPublic Defender Office\nPurdue Extension\nRecorder\nSheriff\nSoil & Water Conservation District\nSuperior Court\nSurveyor\nTreasurer\nVeterans Service Office\nPay Property Tax  Tax Payments\nPrint Tax Bills\nCalendar\nNews & Notices\nHow Do I?  Browse the County Staff\nFind an Event\nFind a Location\nFind a Service\nSubmit a Request\nView FAQs\nView a Slideshow\nVisit the Meeting Center\nFind a Document  Agendas\nBreaking News\nForms & Applications\nMinutes\nNews & Notices\nUseful Links\nStart Content\nPlay\nPause\n-->\nWelcome to LaGrange, Indiana\nWelcome to the official website for LaGrange County, Indiana Government. Our goal is to provide you with as much information online as we can. Please feel free to browse our site. Please enjoy your visit.\nThe County's Mission Statement is to establish and nurture a local government that is open and accessible, actively seeks citizen involvement, is fiscally accountable, efficient yet courteous, provides for planned growth and sustainable economic development of the county, while preserving our unique character and cultures and without regard to personal or special interests.\nOnline Bill Pay (Not for Property Tax)\nAgendas & Minutes\nMaps\nCommunity Alerts\nLinks\nSocial Media\nRecent News\nUnified Development Ordinance (As revised July 14, 2026)\nCourthouse Grounds and Gazebo Revised Ordinance 2026-03-16B\nCourthouse Grounds and Gazebo License Application\nCourthouse Grounds and Gazebo Key Licensing Terms\nCompost Site\nView All News\nUpcoming Events\nCity Calendar\n-->\nOctober 2026 |\nSun | Mon | Tue | Wed | Thu | Fri | Sat |\n| | | | 1 | 2 | 3 |\n4 | 5 | 6 